<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Westinghouse raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Westinghouse raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley Jennifer Pokrzywinski said she upgraded Westinghouse Electric Corp to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- believes company will announce breakup into industrial and broadcasting businesses between mid-November and mid-December, and estimates breakup value at $18-$22.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/4 to 16-1/8.</p>
</text>
